  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We are announcing new locations for ExpressRoute Direct:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Denver</li>\r\n\t<li>Newport (Wales)</li>\r\n\t<li>Pune</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The new locations support dual 10Gbps or 100Gbps connectivity into Microsoft&#39;s global network.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/expressroute/expressroute-erdirect-about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ExpressRoute Direct</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We are announcing new locations for ExpressRoute Direct:\n\nDenver\n\nNewport (Wales)\n\nPune\n\nThe new locations support dual 10Gbps or 100Gbps connectivity into Microsoft's global network.\n\nLearn more about ExpressRoute Direct ."
  },
